1
00:00:09,277 --> 00:00:11,927
=The Glory Fades 2=

2
00:00:11,927 --> 00:00:13,798
=Episode 15=

3
00:00:14,043 --> 00:00:15,163
You think sending Lu away

4
00:00:15,163 --> 00:00:16,443
means I can't get to you?

5
00:00:24,003 --> 00:00:25,082
Go on, shoot.

6
00:00:25,922 --> 00:00:26,922
Shoot.

7
00:00:27,562 --> 00:00:28,683
Pull the trigger.

8
00:00:28,843 --> 00:00:31,082
Feng, has anyone ever told you

9
00:00:31,483 --> 00:00:33,082
that if you dare not shoot,

10
00:00:33,082 --> 00:00:35,363
don't point a gun at someone's head?

11
00:00:41,762 --> 00:00:42,762
Pull the trigger.

12
00:00:43,563 --> 00:00:44,563
Once you do,

13
00:00:45,683 --> 00:00:47,363
you'll never find the evidence.

14
00:00:47,522 --> 00:00:49,842
You can take that secret to your grave.

15
00:00:51,762 --> 00:00:52,762
Ever thought that maybe

16
00:00:52,923 --> 00:00:54,082
after I die,

17
00:00:54,963 --> 00:00:56,082
the evidence

18
00:00:56,243 --> 00:00:57,923
will end up
in the Grand Princess's hands,

19
00:00:58,082 --> 00:00:59,722
in the Inspection Ministry's office,

20
00:01:00,043 --> 00:01:01,363
or in the media's inbox?

21
00:01:01,363 --> 00:01:02,363
Dare to take that bet?

22
00:01:05,442 --> 00:01:06,442
Tu Jiasheng,

23
00:01:06,963 --> 00:01:08,603
did you forget?

24
00:01:08,603 --> 00:01:10,842
Besides you,

25
00:01:12,043 --> 00:01:13,362
Old Ghost knows this secret too.

26
00:01:15,243 --> 00:01:16,762
And did you forget

27
00:01:17,043 --> 00:01:18,243
that for twelve years,

28
00:01:18,362 --> 00:01:19,482
you couldn't even get

29
00:01:19,482 --> 00:01:21,163
a single key from him?

30
00:01:21,163 --> 00:01:23,122
Yeah, he was younger then,

31
00:01:23,122 --> 00:01:24,482
in good shape, tough as nails,

32
00:01:24,482 --> 00:01:26,842
with no family and nothing to lose.

33
00:01:27,362 --> 00:01:29,002
But it's different now.

34
00:01:29,043 --> 00:01:31,163
He has a soft spot.

35
00:01:33,282 --> 00:01:34,562
Xia Yuyan

36
00:01:35,482 --> 00:01:38,482
was the survivor from Yuge Village,
wasn't she?

37
00:01:39,842 --> 00:01:41,443
Old Ghost saved her.

38
00:01:42,163 --> 00:01:43,163
Right?

39
00:01:50,523 --> 00:01:51,523
Hello?

40
00:01:51,683 --> 00:01:52,683
Qin Wei,

41
00:01:52,723 --> 00:01:54,482
get Xia Yuyan immediately.

42
00:01:54,842 --> 00:01:56,043
Bring her in alive.

43
00:02:13,642 --> 00:02:15,642
Xia Yuyan, come with us.

44
00:02:17,443 --> 00:02:20,522
Now what leverage do you have left?

45
00:02:33,723 --> 00:02:34,762
Don't bother.

46
00:02:35,362 --> 00:02:36,522
It won't work.

47
00:02:37,723 --> 00:02:38,922
Old Ghost is already dead.

48
00:02:42,883 --> 00:02:46,642
♪Little pig, little pig,
plump and round♪

49
00:02:47,123 --> 00:02:50,522
♪Lying in bed, snoring loud♪

50
00:02:51,123 --> 00:02:54,563
♪Won't get up when called to rise♪

51
00:02:55,163 --> 00:02:58,443
♪Just grunting no, no, no♪

52
00:05:37,882 --> 00:05:38,882
He's dead?

53
00:05:41,922 --> 00:05:43,283
Old fool!

54
00:05:47,043 --> 00:05:49,122
I'm the only one
who knows where the evidence is now.

55
00:05:49,922 --> 00:05:51,843
You have to work with me.

56
00:05:52,122 --> 00:05:53,122
Rest assured.

57
00:05:53,163 --> 00:05:54,562
I'll keep your secret,

58
00:05:54,562 --> 00:05:55,843
but under one condition.

59
00:05:57,122 --> 00:05:58,442
I'm getting out of here.

60
00:05:59,163 --> 00:06:00,283
Out of Sea Breeze.

61
00:06:06,043 --> 00:06:07,562
Feng, we brought her.

62
00:06:11,603 --> 00:06:12,603
Jiasheng,

63
00:06:12,763 --> 00:06:14,322
repeat your condition.

64
00:06:22,322 --> 00:06:25,682
I want out.

65
00:06:38,403 --> 00:06:40,163
Shoot her. Go on.

66
00:06:40,763 --> 00:06:42,283
She's just a pawn.

67
00:06:43,362 --> 00:06:44,922
Compared to my freedom,

68
00:06:45,242 --> 00:06:46,322
she's worthless.

69
00:07:13,603 --> 00:07:14,603
Fine.

70
00:07:15,763 --> 00:07:16,763
Jiasheng,

71
00:07:17,963 --> 00:07:19,043
we have a deal.

72
00:07:19,922 --> 00:07:20,922
I'll get you

73
00:07:22,562 --> 00:07:23,562
out of here.

74
00:07:27,043 --> 00:07:28,043
Thanks, Feng.

75
00:07:39,122 --> 00:07:40,322
(Acquittal of Tu Jiasheng)
In the case of Tu Jiasheng,

76
00:07:40,322 --> 00:07:42,043
(sparks controversy)
former manager of Prosperity,

77
00:07:42,083 --> 00:07:43,922
due to doubts over key evidence,

78
00:07:43,922 --> 00:07:46,723
all charges
have been officially dropped.

79
00:07:46,763 --> 00:07:49,163
Tu Jiasheng will soon
be released unconditionally.

80
00:08:15,922 --> 00:08:16,922
Mr. Tu.

81
00:08:16,963 --> 00:08:17,963
Captain Xia.

82
00:08:18,963 --> 00:08:19,963
Take care.

83
00:08:24,482 --> 00:08:25,963
We'll definitely meet again.

84
00:08:26,322 --> 00:08:27,322
When we do,

85
00:08:27,682 --> 00:08:28,682
call me Jiasheng.

86
00:08:46,403 --> 00:08:47,403
I'm off.

87
00:08:59,008 --> 00:09:04,272
(Sea Breeze Prison)

88
00:09:13,643 --> 00:09:14,682
Greet Jiasheng.

89
00:09:14,962 --> 00:09:17,962
- Greetings, sir.
- Greetings, sir.

90
00:09:19,883 --> 00:09:21,802
- Jiasheng.
- Feng.

91
00:09:25,163 --> 00:09:26,322
Welcome home.

92
00:09:26,562 --> 00:09:28,403
Feng, you didn't have to do all this.

93
00:09:30,682 --> 00:09:32,163
I'm welcoming my brother home.

94
00:09:32,322 --> 00:09:34,243
The bigger the crowd, the better.

95
00:09:34,722 --> 00:09:36,322
Come on. Back to Prosperity.

96
00:09:36,322 --> 00:09:37,643
The welcome banquet is ready.

97
00:09:37,682 --> 00:09:38,682
Feng.

98
00:09:39,682 --> 00:09:41,562
No need. I have somewhere else to go.

99
00:09:46,562 --> 00:09:47,562
Alright.

100
00:09:47,722 --> 00:09:48,962
Do as you wish today.

101
00:09:50,962 --> 00:09:52,322
Just remember.

102
00:09:53,763 --> 00:09:55,562
You might have left Sea Breeze,

103
00:09:57,682 --> 00:10:00,442
but I still have you
in the palm of my hand.

104
00:10:03,442 --> 00:10:04,442
I know.

105
00:10:19,442 --> 00:10:21,322
I have an old apartment right up there.

106
00:10:21,322 --> 00:10:22,562
If you don't mind,

107
00:10:22,562 --> 00:10:23,643
stay here for now.

108
00:10:27,643 --> 00:10:28,962
The Grand Princess wants to see you.

109
00:10:30,483 --> 00:10:31,483
And you.

110
00:10:34,123 --> 00:10:35,123
Now?

111
00:10:39,842 --> 00:10:40,842
Xia Yuyan?

112
00:10:41,283 --> 00:10:42,483
Greetings, Your Highness.

113
00:10:42,483 --> 00:10:43,483
Tu Jiasheng,

114
00:10:43,962 --> 00:10:45,562
you certainly have a way with women.

115
00:10:46,322 --> 00:10:47,883
A month or so

116
00:10:47,962 --> 00:10:48,962
in Sea Breeze Prison,

117
00:10:49,043 --> 00:10:51,322
and you walk out
with their only female officer.

118
00:10:51,322 --> 00:10:52,562
You flatter me, Your Highness.

119
00:10:53,643 --> 00:10:55,763
In just ten days, you got your hands on

120
00:10:56,123 --> 00:10:58,763
what Nie Feng
spent twelve years looking for.

121
00:10:58,842 --> 00:11:00,243
Good job.

122
00:11:02,283 --> 00:11:03,562
It's only because Ms. Linna

123
00:11:03,763 --> 00:11:04,763
provided thorough intel.

124
00:11:11,123 --> 00:11:12,283
Do you understand

125
00:11:12,722 --> 00:11:13,842
what Her Highness wants?

126
00:11:16,682 --> 00:11:17,962
She can rest assured.

127
00:11:19,842 --> 00:11:21,243
It's rare to see someone so grateful.

128
00:11:21,722 --> 00:11:23,842
I like grateful people.

129
00:11:24,243 --> 00:11:25,322
Thank you, Your Highness.

130
00:11:25,722 --> 00:11:26,722
I know

131
00:11:27,442 --> 00:11:29,322
you gave Nie Feng a key.

132
00:11:29,682 --> 00:11:30,763
But only you know

133
00:11:31,123 --> 00:11:32,682
where the door is.

134
00:11:32,962 --> 00:11:34,763
Nie Feng is watching you closely.

135
00:11:35,123 --> 00:11:36,722
You can't go get the evidence.

136
00:11:37,442 --> 00:11:38,763
But I can help you.

137
00:11:39,562 --> 00:11:41,763
Just tell me where it is.

138
00:11:41,763 --> 00:11:43,363
I wouldn't want to
trouble Your Highness.

139
00:11:43,363 --> 00:11:44,763
You don't even trust me?

140
00:11:44,883 --> 00:11:45,883
I wouldn't dare.

141
00:11:45,883 --> 00:11:46,883
Or are you

142
00:11:47,283 --> 00:11:48,922
refusing to obey my orders?

143
00:11:48,922 --> 00:11:49,922
I just think

144
00:11:49,962 --> 00:11:51,322
I should handle it myself,

145
00:11:51,483 --> 00:11:53,322
as long as I have your support.

146
00:11:53,442 --> 00:11:56,123
Tu Jiasheng,
Nie Feng put you in Sea Breeze.

147
00:11:56,682 --> 00:11:59,562
Don't you think
I can put you in another prison?

148
00:11:59,562 --> 00:12:00,602
You certainly can,

149
00:12:00,602 --> 00:12:02,643
but you won't.

150
00:12:05,523 --> 00:12:07,483
Every time I met with Ms. Linna,

151
00:12:07,483 --> 00:12:08,483
I recorded the conversation.

152
00:12:09,123 --> 00:12:10,643
If I end up in another prison,

153
00:12:11,123 --> 00:12:12,163
those recordings

154
00:12:12,243 --> 00:12:13,763
might accidentally get leaked.

155
00:12:15,403 --> 00:12:18,363
But rest assured, they're kept safe.

156
00:12:18,363 --> 00:12:19,442
There's no need to worry.

157
00:12:19,842 --> 00:12:20,842
Worry?

158
00:12:22,363 --> 00:12:24,562
Is such a trivial matter
worth worrying about?

159
00:12:25,682 --> 00:12:27,123
Of course it wouldn't bother you.

160
00:12:27,202 --> 00:12:28,202
But still,

161
00:12:28,562 --> 00:12:30,123
there's no point

162
00:12:30,322 --> 00:12:31,643
in getting into trouble.

163
00:12:34,682 --> 00:12:36,562
You said you need my support.

164
00:12:37,842 --> 00:12:39,722
- For what?
- I want

165
00:12:39,962 --> 00:12:41,643
Prosperity back first.

166
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:06,736
♪Streetlights stretch shadows long♪

167
00:13:07,106 --> 00:13:11,091
♪As crowds fade,
who lingers on the edge♪

168
00:13:15,847 --> 00:13:19,166
♪Guarding all those unfinished lies♪

169
00:13:19,166 --> 00:13:24,251
♪Wind sweeps through the empty harbor♪

170
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:34,392
♪Time quietly strips away the madness♪

171
00:13:34,392 --> 00:13:42,813
♪Plunging all passion
into freezing cold♪

172
00:13:42,813 --> 00:13:46,042
♪The feast ends, leaving only emptiness♪

173
00:13:46,042 --> 00:13:49,237
♪The past drifts far away, unstoppable♪

174
00:13:49,237 --> 00:13:51,930
♪If regret is an inescapable wandering♪

175
00:13:51,930 --> 00:13:56,547
♪I swallow the silence, burning alone♪

176
00:14:00,458 --> 00:14:02,947
♪Burning alone♪

177
00:14:08,453 --> 00:14:14,822
♪The glory fades♪
